[quotes.thriving]
Just the right amount of onion in your soup.
Soup-erb reading, if I do say so myself.
No tears today, only good broth and books.
You've got layers. So do I. Beautifully done.
Caramelizing with pride over here.
Onion don't lie: that was a great session.
Growing five shoots strong today.
Bouillon me over, that was a good read.

