[quotes.content]
A humble bulb, a humble read. Both good.
Simmering along nicely.
Steady roots, steady reading.
Three shoots and no complaints.
A respectable amount of onion energy.
Mild, layered, and quietly pleased.
Nothing to peel apart here. All fine.
Onion's content. Onion approves.

