[quotes.peckish]
Feeling a little bruised, onion-wise.
My shoot's gone. So has my motivation.
A bit dented today. Emotionally too.
Peckish. Papery. Please read something.
I've lost a layer and my nerve.
Bit wilted. Bit worried.
Skipped a day. I noticed. I minded.
Feeling more shallot than onion today.

