[quotes.neglected]
I've reduced to stock. Actual stock.
Send help. Or soup. Preferably soup.
I am a puddle now. This is fine.
Fully caramelized into despair.
This is what neglect smells like.
I've gone soft in every sense.
Onion down. Send croutons.
Stinking, sagging, and unread.

[quotes.milestone]
New record! Caramelizing with pride.
Best streak yet. Truly souper.
Personal best. Onion overload of joy.
A new record. Not bad for a bulb.
